    "description": "The monitoring of plant communities on Verte I., Guillou I., Cochons I (where the rabbit has been eradicated in 1992, 1994 and 1997 respectively), and on two control islands, Cimeti\u00e8re I. (with rabbit) and Mayes I. (without rabbit) is being carried out since the time of rabbit eradication (method of contact points applied to a total of 150 line transects, annually in January-February). These records also allow the analysis of the impact of climate change on the dynamics of plant communities.",
